  - id: head_coverings_and_the_lords_table
    displayName: Head Coverings and the Lord's Table
    flavorText: Paul restates the Lord's Supper as tradition received directly from
      the Lord and rebukes divisions at the shared meal where some go hungry while
      others are drunken.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Addresses propriety regarding head-covering when praying or prophesying
      and serious abuses at the meal accompanying the Lord's Supper, restating the
      Supper's institution as tradition received directly of the Lord.
    deliveredByManagerId: paul
    managerId: head_covering_and_lords_table
