  - id: one_body_many_members
    displayName: One Body, Many Members
    flavorText: Paul describes the diverse gifts given by the one Spirit and likens
      the church to a body of many necessary members, none greater than another.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Explains that spiritual gifts, though diverse, come from the one Spirit
      for the common good, using the human body as a metaphor for the church so that
      no gift or member regards itself as unnecessary or superior.
    deliveredByManagerId: paul
    managerId: spiritual_gifts_one_body
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
