  - id: order_in_the_assembly
    displayName: Order in the Assembly
    flavorText: Paul regulates tongues and prophecy in the gathered church, insisting
      all things be done 'decently and in order' for the edification of everyone
      present.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Regulates speaking in tongues and prophesying when the church gathers,
      prioritizing intelligible edification of the whole church over unintelligible
      individual experience and setting practical limits for orderly worship.
    deliveredByManagerId: paul
    managerId: order_in_the_assembly
