  - id: the_resurrection_of_the_dead
    displayName: The Resurrection of the Dead
    flavorText: Paul lists the eyewitnesses of the risen Christ and declares that
      the dead will be raised incorruptible, changed 'in a moment, in the twinkling
      of an eye.'
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Defends the bodily resurrection of Christ as the foundation of the gospel,
      lists the eyewitnesses to the risen Christ, and explains the nature of the
      resurrection body, closing with the promise of victory over death.
    deliveredByManagerId: paul
